# Project: Facebook Group Lead Monitor

- Python 3.11+, async where possible.
- Stack: Playwright (`async_api`), SQLite, Flask, httpx, pyyaml.
- NEVER use Selenium. NEVER use Facebook's official API (deprecated for groups).
- MONITOR ONLY. No auto-comment, no auto-post, no auto-message. Ever.
- All user-facing text in the dashboard is Vietnamese.
- Files stay single-purpose: `fb.py`, `store.py`, `score.py`, `draft.py`, `notify_email.py`, `main.py`, `dashboard/app.py`.
- Use `launch_persistent_context` for session persistence.
- Type hints + short docstring on every function.
- Comments explaining WHY when touching Playwright or Facebook GraphQL (fragile shapes).
- Do not send Telegram or any messaging-app notifications — email + browser notifications only.
